graph TD
    A[Protein Degradation] --> B[Amino Acid Release]
    B --> C{Amino Acid Type?}
    C -->|Glucogenic| D[Pyruvate Formation]
    C -->|Ketogenic| E[Acetyl-CoA Formation]
    C -->|Both| F[Multiple Pathways]
    
    D --> G[Gluconeogenesis Entry]
    G --> H[Glucose Production]
    
    E --> I[TCA Cycle Entry]
    I --> J[Energy Production]
    
    F --> K[Ammonia Release]
    K --> L[Urea Cycle]
    L --> M[Urea Production]
    M --> N[Nitrogen Excretion]
    
    %% Alternative pathway
    B --> O[Transamination]
    O --> P[Glutamate Formation]
    P --> Q[Glutamate Dehydrogenase]
    Q --> R[Ammonia Production]
    R --> L
    
    %% Regulation
    H --> S[Energy Status]
    J --> S
    N --> T[Nitrogen Balance]
    S --> U{Energy Sufficient?}
    T --> V{Nitrogen Sufficient?}
    U -->|Yes| W[Catabolism Inhibition]
    U -->|No| X[Catabolism Continuation]
    V -->|Yes| Y[Nitrogen Conservation]
    V -->|No| Z[Nitrogen Excretion]
    
    %% Key proteins
    AA[Proteases] --> B
    BB[Transaminases] --> O
    CC[Glutamate Dehydrogenase] --> Q
    DD[Urea Cycle Enzymes] --> L
    EE[Pyruvate] --> D
    FF[Acetyl-CoA] --> E
    GG[Ammonia] --> K
    HH[Urea] --> M
    
